{"n":94,"verses":[{"v":1,"en":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast","bn":"আমি কি আপনার বক্ষ উম্মুক্ত করে দেইনি","w":[["أَلَمۡ","Have not","alam",31],["نَشۡرَحۡ","We expanded","nashraḥ",1348],["لَكَ","for you","laka",71],["صَدۡرَكَ","your breast","ṣadraka",257]]},{"v":2,"en":"And We removed from you your burden","bn":"আমি লাঘব করেছি আপনার বোঝা","w":[["وَوَضَعۡنَا","And We removed","wawaḍaʿnā",484],["عَنكَ","from you","ʿanka",22],["وِزۡرَكَ","your burden","wiz'raka",730]]},{"v":3,"en":"Which had weighed upon your back","bn":"যা ছিল আপনার জন্যে অতিশয় দুঃসহ।","w":[["ٱلَّذِيٓ","Which","alladhī",7],["أَنقَضَ","weighed upon","anqaḍa",4725],["ظَهۡرَكَ","your back","ẓahraka",609]]},{"v":4,"en":"And raised high for you your repute","bn":"আমি আপনার আলোচনাকে সমুচ্চ করেছি।","w":[["وَرَفَعۡنَا","And We raised high","warafaʿnā",453],["لَكَ","for you","laka",71],["ذِكۡرَكَ","your reputation","dhik'raka",146]]},{"v":5,"en":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease","bn":"নিশ্চয় কষ্টের সাথে স্বস্তি রয়েছে।","w":[["فَإِنَّ","So indeed","fa-inna",5],["مَعَ","with","maʿa",69],["ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","the hardship","l-ʿus'ri",1270],["يُسۡرًا","(is) ease","yus'ran",1034]]},{"v":6,"en":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease","bn":"নিশ্চয় কষ্টের সাথে স্বস্তি রয়েছে।","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",5],["مَعَ","with","maʿa",69],["ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","the hardship","l-ʿus'ri",1270],["يُسۡرٗا","(is) ease","yus'ran",1034]]},{"v":7,"en":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]","bn":"অতএব, যখন অবসর পান পরিশ্রম করুন।","w":[["فَإِذَا","So when","fa-idhā",24],["فَرَغۡتَ","you have finished","faraghta",2760],["فَٱنصَبۡ","then labor hard","fa-inṣab",2811]]},{"v":8,"en":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing","bn":"এবং আপনার পালনকর্তার প্রতি মনোনিবেশ করুন।","w":[["وَإِلَىٰ","And to","wa-ilā",15],["رَبِّكَ","your Lord","rabbika",12],["فَٱرۡغَب","turn your attention","fa-ir'ghab",1457]]}]}